---
description: Testing, validation, and change-quality requirements
alwaysApply: true
---

- Derive tests from the acceptance criteria in `docs/PRODUCT_SPEC.md` and boundaries in `docs/TECHNICAL_SPEC.md`.
- Test domain invariants and permission denials, not only happy-path UI.
- Add concurrency/idempotency tests for booking confirmation, calendar conflicts, signatures, webhooks, and hold expiry.
- Test both locales and critical accessibility behavior. Use synthetic data only.
- Validate schema generation, inspect migrations, and test clean apply plus upgrade path for data changes.
- Before commit run typecheck, lint, affected tests, and production build when build/runtime inputs change. Never weaken checks to make a change pass.
